From: Lorenzo Bianconi <lorenzo@kernel.org>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 23:39:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Lorenzo Bianconi's RX checksum kfunc series v5, patches 1-3,
 for the bench

Patches 1-3 of "[PATCH bpf-next v5 0/8] Add the the capability to load HW
RX checksum in eBPF programs" (Message-Id
20260715-bpf-xdp-meta-rxcksum-v5-0-623d5c0d0ab7@kernel.org), squashed:
bpf_xdp_metadata_rx_checksum(), the veth and the ice callbacks. The copy
of enum xdp_checksum in patch 1 is dropped, because the skb core
extensions series already defines it.
---
